          "type": "text",
          "align": "start",
          "light": false,
          "box": {
           "w": 584,
           "h": 501,
           "y": 1199
          },
          "html": "Texas weather is notoriously unpredictable. When massive hail, straight-line winds, or hurricane-force rains tear through your neighborhood, dealing with the aftermath can be overwhelming. Filing an insurance claim is often a confusing and frustrating process. It is important to remember that the insurance adjuster works for the insurance company—their job is to manage the company's financial exposure. You need a roofing expert working for you.<br><br>Core Four Roofing specializes in comprehensive storm damage recovery. From the moment you call us, we take the burden off your shoulders. We start by providing emergency tarping to stop immediate leaks. Then, we perform an exhaustive, photo-documented inspection to identify every compromised shingle, dented vent, and hidden impact zone. We meet your insurance adjuster on-site, ensuring no damage is overlooked and that your final payout reflects the true cost of a complete, code-compliant roof replacement.",
